7; margin-top: 24px;">This challenge supplies both. For measurement, we pro=
vide a representative benchmark that evaluates individual stages and the en=
d-to-end pipeline under shared tasks, spanning both third-person and egocen=
tric human video. For scale, participants develop and validate their soluti=
ons on a curated subset of our large-scale in-house dataset with held-out g=
